                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c23db3cb-a3d4-3695-a0cc-46912ffcf05c",
                        "entry_id": "e9d1b25d-0af0-3bfe-a016-8c759a85496b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Person, die Frauen nicht leiden kann/hasst/verabscheut"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "269d0687-7efb-4c17-8772-4a5247161d09",
                                "sense_id": "c23db3cb-a3d4-3695-a0cc-46912ffcf05c",
                                "text": "„Für Gegnerinnen ist Jair Bolsonaro ein Rassist und Frauenfeind.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "84b007dd-0e24-469c-93d1-b5071d2be11a",
                                "sense_id": "c23db3cb-a3d4-3695-a0cc-46912ffcf05c",
                                "text": "„Man empfindet es als eine Unterstellung, wenn plötzlich alle Migranten mit muslimischem Hintergrund als Frauenfeinde und Sexisten verurteilt werden.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "806756fb-92cd-4c9e-b3d9-9a118bab6836",
                        "source_entry_id": "e9d1b25d-0af0-3bfe-a016-8c759a85496b",
                        "source_sense_id": "c23db3cb-a3d4-3695-a0cc-46912ffcf05c",
                        "source_sense_description": "Person, die Frauen nicht leiden kann/hasst/verabscheut",
                        "target_lang_word": "misogynist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "misogynist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a3cf0732-2d58-3cf4-b8b9-e82a38f40b15",
                                        "entry_id": "e786ff0f-e41e-3419-a362-4e90eee9ee16",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who professes misogyny; a hater of women."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a19101c1-dd74-4d7b-b8ff-e5feb01b43cd",
                                                "sense_id": "a3cf0732-2d58-3cf4-b8b9-e82a38f40b15",
                                                "text": "\"Confound all women, I say!\" muttered the young misogynist."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bba811be-1ee2-4202-baab-b224bb7ccdf3",
                                                "sense_id": "a3cf0732-2d58-3cf4-b8b9-e82a38f40b15",
                                                "text": "Job, like myself, is a bit of a misogynist - I fancy chiefly owing to the fact of his having been one of a family of seventeen - and the feelings expressed upon his countenance when he realised that he was not only being embraced publicly, and without authorisation on his own part, but also in the presence of his masters, were too mixed and painful to admit of accurate description."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db70a33b-2c1c-46a7-9a38-9d2654c56e00",
                                                "sense_id": "a3cf0732-2d58-3cf4-b8b9-e82a38f40b15",
                                                "text": "To combat perceived misrepresentation, incels attempt to distinguish themselves both from violent misogynists and from right-wing extremists."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f8254d6-1edb-3920-a904-a2b7d8983605",
                                        "entry_id": "e786ff0f-e41e-3419-a362-4e90eee9ee16",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who displays prejudice against or looks down upon women."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "misogynist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "74bfe591-0163-3b2d-8f0b-508a90c4d44a",
                                        "entry_id": "5c957bbe-1d6b-398f-ad66-875a50c3155f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Misogynistic; relating to or exhibiting misogyny."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11fa8795-2e4d-4d69-80d1-f29591886f4e",
                                                "sense_id": "74bfe591-0163-3b2d-8f0b-508a90c4d44a",
                                                "text": "Authors push back against criticism by formulating a boundary so contributors can be viewed as serious, rational individuals, rather than misogynist extremists."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9e54b91c-540e-42ee-907f-d034d0cd691b",
                        "source_entry_id": "e9d1b25d-0af0-3bfe-a016-8c759a85496b",
                        "source_sense_id": "c23db3cb-a3d4-3695-a0cc-46912ffcf05c",
                        "source_sense_description": "Person, die Frauen nicht leiden kann/hasst/verabscheut",
                        "target_lang_word": "womanhater",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "womanhater",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8a1e3ca9-f7c2-3684-af61-a7f9f7804128",
                                        "entry_id": "5646d598-1a84-33ec-b31a-18300c080d7c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who hates women or the female sex; a misogynist."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7a8ff90-9523-4506-9426-d223acc49804",
                                                "sense_id": "8a1e3ca9-f7c2-3684-af61-a7f9f7804128",
                                                "text": "I suppose, the gentleman’s a womanhater; but, Sir, I think you ought to remember, that you had a mother: and pray, if it had not been for a woman, where would you have been, colonel?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5266cbdd-76cf-4225-8a01-1100d2bd1469",
                                                "sense_id": "8a1e3ca9-f7c2-3684-af61-a7f9f7804128",
                                                "text": "From his insertion of these strictures on women, which are not the most courtly, it has been inferred that he was a womanhater; but that he was not so, appears from some of his prologues, especially from that to the ‘Knight of the Tower.’"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79c52c2f-f1ad-47a7-9faf-fd5c54ef40b9",
                                                "sense_id": "8a1e3ca9-f7c2-3684-af61-a7f9f7804128",
                                                "text": "The petticoated-intrusion may be resented by a few cross-grained “theologs,” bachelors before their time, or womanhaters because some boarding-school miss has failed to fulfill their idea of fidelity."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
